  "title": "Pignoli Cookies",
  "description": "These golden pignoli cookies are easy to make with pine nuts, almond paste, egg whites, and sugar for a deliciously chewy and nutty Italian treat!",
  "authors": [
    "Adele"
  ],
  "date_published": "1997-10-04T23:26:05-04:00",
